\label{fig:ablation}
\end{figure}

\section{Conclusion}
This study highlights the limitations of traditional next-token prediction approaches while advocating for the exploration of multi-token prediction and seed-conditioning techniques. The initial findings suggest potential benefits in algorithmic creativity; however, challenges in quantifying creativity and ensuring generalizability remain. Future work will focus on refining methodologies and expanding the range of tasks to further evaluate the creative capabilities of LLMs.

